[[File:Img item key.png|thumb|right|The Key for unlocking chests]]
The '''Vault''' is where the player will store their stolen chests and unlock them, the player can either use keys to unlock the chests, allow the Tank Cat to manually break 50% of the lock over time, or use Cat Food to instantly unlock them. There are traps, accessories and clothing chests that drop the corresponding items upon unlock. Keys get refilled every 10 minutes, and it will stop refilling when the player holds at least 10 keys, the player can also buy Keys with Friend Points.

